{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["准绳的异象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又举目观看，见一人手拿准绳。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我说：「你往哪里去？」他对我说：「要去量耶路撒冷，看有多宽多长。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["与我说话的天使去的时候，又有一位天使迎着他来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["对他说：「你跑去告诉那少年人说，耶路撒冷必有人居住，好像无城墙的乡村，因为人民和牲畜甚多。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华说：我要作耶路撒冷四围的火城，并要作其中的荣耀。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼唤被掳者归回"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华说：「我从前分散你们在天的四方",{"noteId":0},"，现在你们要从北方之地逃回。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["与巴比伦人同住的锡安民哪，应当逃脱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["万军之耶和华说，在显出荣耀之后，差遣我去惩罚那掳掠你们的列国，摸你们的就是摸他眼中的瞳人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["看哪，我",{"noteId":1},"要向他们抡手，他们就必作服事他们之人的掳物，你们便知道万军之耶和华差遣我了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["锡安城啊，应当欢乐歌唱，因为我来要住在你中间。这是耶和华说的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那时，必有许多国归附耶和华，作他",{"noteId":2},"的子民。他",{"noteId":3},"要住在你中间，你就知道万军之耶和华差遣我到你那里去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和华必收回犹大作他圣地的分，也必再拣选耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡有血气的都当在耶和华面前静默无声；因为他兴起，从圣所出来了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是犹如天的四风","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":6}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：他","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":9}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"原文是我","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":11}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"原文是我","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}